1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,600
«Ishlagan pulingni stolga qo'y!»

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,900
Dadam buni nazarda tutmagan edi.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,200
«Biz seni yigirma yil boqdik!»

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,900
Asl ma'nosi: men senga kerak bo'lmay qolishdan qo'rqaman.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,900
«Meni tug'ing deb so'ramaganman!»

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:21,000
Asl ma'nosi: dada, bir marta bo'lsa ham men bilan faxrlaning.

7
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,200
U birinchi oyligidan dadasiga sovg'a olgan edi.

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:26,500
Berishga ulgurmadi.

9
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,300
Dadasi esa yigirma yildan beri unga uy uchun pul yig'ardi.

10
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,100
Ikkalasi ham bir-birini yaxshi ko'rardi.

11
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,300
Faqat buni aytishni bilmasdi.

12
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,800
«Sizni yaxshi ko'raman, dada.»

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,900
«Men ham seni yaxshi ko'raman, o'g'lim.»

14
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,600
Ba'zan odamlar boshqa gapni aytadi,

15
00:00:47,100 --> 00:00:48,900
qalbida esa boshqasini his qiladi.

16
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,800
Bugun yaqin insoningizga «yaxshi ko'raman» deng.

17
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:55,000
Ayta olmasangiz, shu videoni yuboring.

